Hi there! 

Maddie here from Originality.AI. 

I wanted to send you a quick note about the feedback you submitted last
week! It was insanely valuable to us. We REALLY appreciate the time and
effort you took to provide us with honest and helpful feedback. It will
absolutely help us improve. 

If you haven't submitted your feedback yet and would like to, please do
so here <https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZ0YWxseS5zbyUyRnIlMkZ3THpWbzE=&sig=ChmpWTWw4grGqNkq4oJMLNLYmfk9f3NZaEzDEyPwJB2b&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29137>. 

We have listened attentively and are prioritizing the following: 

1. We've taken note and hear you on the pain 

**false positives** have caused. Please be assured that we are fully
committed to addressing these concerns and are working diligently to
reduce the occurrence of false positives. Our team is working hard to
improve our detection as well as enhance education around false
positives and why they happen. In the meantime make sure you take a look
at this article we wrote about false
positives: https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdG9yLWZhbHNlLXBvc2l0aXZlcw==&sig=EcunuKbXZoe5cUziW9Ty5D5kHHKRjD9z37X32MPmTn9G&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29148
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdG9yLWZhbHNlLXBvc2l0aXZlcw==&sig=EcunuKbXZoe5cUziW9Ty5D5kHHKRjD9z37X32MPmTn9G&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29148>

2. In response to your feedback regarding 

**data privacy,** we have developed a new feature that will allow you to


**opt out** of having your data used to train our AI model. We
understand the importance of respecting your privacy preferences, and
this feature will provide you with more control over your data! We
expedited the development of this feature and it is now live on our
app! 

3. We heard that a lot of you appreciate the superior accuracy that we
are able to provide with our tool in comparison to other tools on the
market. We will continue to work on improving our accuracy with the
continued training of our model. To learn more about our accuracy, check
out our accuracy study
here: https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdGlvbi1hY2N1cmFjeQ==&sig=B5BW9Jb5YVK5gdNYKX5eedccFr7xZDEJ3Rtj5syosQ3b&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29149
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdGlvbi1hY2N1cmFjeQ==&sig=B5BW9Jb5YVK5gdNYKX5eedccFr7xZDEJ3Rtj5syosQ3b&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29149>

Lastly, we are excited to let you know that we will be participating in
the upcoming Collision Conference <https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZjb2xsaXNpb25jb25mLmNvbSUyRg==&sig=F1iQZRiG9F7Muad5Bc5ttpvQ1JZcmeaw2Rn4saHLbuhj&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29147>, taking
place in Toronto this week!  

  

https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZjb2xsaXNpb25jb25mLmNvbSUyRg==&sig=F1iQZRiG9F7Muad5Bc5ttpvQ1JZcmeaw2Rn4saHLbuhj&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29147 

Come see us at our booth! We will be at booth 

**number B613**, during our exhibition tomorrow ( Tuesday June 27th). We
are super eager to meet you in person and for us to connect and share
our latest advancements in AI technology and what's coming up next for
Originality.AI!  <https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haQ==&sig=2ArWeYUEdyhUXbF1v4eKEN35Mh5bAVXuF6NRRA6Eq41A&iat=1687806952&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=DhaMi2VuWeem5Hl5sYAK8kd34Lv0tENHU%2FMre%2FD2p0pgkWKkZSHchujLb4Y%3D%3AyVSkqiAdEcf6NCAwCvVTabUJha70dn7g&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1885A2049A61A29146>

If you would like to book a time to meet with me, email me directly at

**maddie@originality.ai **

Once again, thanks so much for being part of the Originality.ai
community. We greatly value your trust, and we remain committed to
continuously improving our services to meet your expectations. 

We look forward to meeting some of you at the Collision Conference!

Best regards,

